<title>USA: Jack Henry raises qtly dividend to $0.055.</title>
<headline>Jack Henry raises qtly dividend to $0.055.</headline>
<dateline>MONETT, Mo. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jack Henry &amp; Associates Inc said Wednesday its directors had approved a 3.1 percent increase in the quarterly dividend, to $0.055 a share from $0.053, payable May 28, record May 14.</p>
<p>At April 29, the company had 18.2 million common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Jack Henry &amp; Associates provides integrated computer systems and ATM networking products for banks and other financial institutions.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
